      "text": "\u00a73. All agency heads should review Executive Order No. 59 issued January 15, 1968 concerning emergency contracts which order requires that the Mayor, the Department of Investigation and other City agencies be notified immediately of any Declaration of Emergency, together with a record of competitive bids or proposals obtained. This notification must be made prior to the actual awarding of the contract. Each agency head must insure that Executive Order No. 59 is being strictly complied with by his agency.",
